<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/4f1de64dc1be474a/EP_Large-Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus-2025.webp"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/best-of/%5BlistId%5D/page-87d2dc40e1048963.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Best Robotic Pool Cleaners for In-Ground Pools (2026) - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="In-ground pools benefit from stronger wall coverage, longer runtimes, and better filtration—especially in larger, deeper installations."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/best-of/inground"/><meta property="og:title" content="Best Robotic Pool Cleaners for In-Ground Pools (2026)"/><meta property="og:description" content="In-ground pools benefit from stronger wall coverage, longer runtimes, and better filtration—especially in larger, deeper installations."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://via.placeholder.com/1200x630?text=The+Pool+Lab"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><header class="mb-5 text-center"><h1 class="display-4 mb-3">Best Robotic Pool Cleaners for In-Ground Pools (2026)</h1><p class="lead">In-ground pools benefit from stronger wall coverage, longer runtimes, and better filtration—especially in larger, deeper installations.</p></header><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto"><div class="mb-4"><p>In-ground pools often require more runtime and better wall coverage than above-ground pools. If your pool is average size, many mid-range robots perform very well. If your pool is large or deep, you should prioritize longer cycles and efficient coverage. Start with <a href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-large-pools">Best for Large Pools</a> if size is a concern.</p><h3>Quick Comparison</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Pick</th><th>Best For</th><th>Why It Fits In-Ground</th><th>Link</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</td><td>Most in-ground pools</td><td>Strong baseline coverage</td><td><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Review</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20">Check price</a></td></tr><tr><td>Dolphin Premier</td><td>Seasonal debris</td><td>Flexible filtration</td><td><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Review</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20">Check price</a></td></tr><tr><td>Polaris 9650iQ Sport</td><td>Premium performance</td><td>Efficient coverage + strong build</td><td><a href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Review</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20">Check price</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="card bg-light mb-5"><div class="card-body"><h5 class="card-title">Selection Criteria</h5><ul class="mb-0"><li>Floor + wall coverage appropriate for in-ground layouts</li><li>Runtime suitable for typical in-ground pool sizes</li><li>Filtration design that matches debris conditions</li><li>Maintenance workflow that encourages frequent use</li><li>Good ownership value for the tier</li></ul></div></div></div></div><h2 class="text-center mb-4">The Shortlist</h2><div class="row mb-5"><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mb-4"><div class="card h-100 border-primary"><div class="card-header bg-primary text-white text-center fw-bold">Best In-Ground Overall</div><div class="p-3 bg-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height:200px"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/4f1de64dc1be474a/EP_Large-Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus-2025.webp" class="img-fluid" alt="Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="card-body text-center d-flex flex-column"><h5 class="card-title h6">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</h5><div class="card-text small text-muted flex-grow-1"><p>A great baseline choice for many in-ground pools. It balances coverage and maintenance simplicity, making it easy to run consistently—which matters more than people expect.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm mt-2" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Read Full Review</a></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mb-4"><div class="card h-100 border-primary"><div class="card-header bg-primary text-white text-center fw-bold">Best for Seasonal Debris</div><div class="p-3 bg-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height:200px"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Dolphin Premier" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="card-body text-center d-flex flex-column"><h5 class="card-title h6">Dolphin Premier</h5><div class="card-text small text-muted flex-grow-1"><p>Ideal when debris conditions change across the year. This is a strong fit for pools that deal with leaves in the fall and finer debris in warmer months.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm mt-2" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Read Full Review</a></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mb-4"><div class="card h-100 border-primary"><div class="card-header bg-primary text-white text-center fw-bold">Best Premium In-Ground</div><div class="p-3 bg-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height:200px"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6" class="img-fluid" alt="Polaris 9650iQ Sport" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="card-body text-center d-flex flex-column"><h5 class="card-title h6">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</h5><div class="card-text small text-muted flex-grow-1"><p>A premium pick when you want more refined coverage behavior and a stronger feature set. Best for owners who want a “set it and forget it” experience and are willing to pay for it.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm mt-2" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Read Full Review</a></div></div></div></div><h2 class="text-center mb-4">Comparison Table</h2><div class="table-responsive mb-5"><table class="table table-striped table-hover border"><thead class="table-dark"><tr><th>Model</th><th>Best For</th><th>Approx. Price</th><th>Key Feature</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="fw-bold"><a class="text-decoration-none" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</a></td><td><span class="badge bg-info text-dark">Best In-Ground Overall</span></td><td>$<!-- -->799</td><td>CleverClean Navigation:</td><td><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm fw-bold text-nowrap ">Check Price</a></td></tr><tr><td class="fw-bold"><a class="text-decoration-none" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Dolphin Premier</a></td><td><span class="badge bg-info text-dark">Best for Seasonal Debris</span></td><td>$<!-- -->1599</td><td>Multi-Media Filtration:</td><td><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm fw-bold text-nowrap ">Check Price</a></td></tr><tr><td class="fw-bold"><a class="text-decoration-none" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</a></td><td><span class="badge bg-info text-dark">Best Premium In-Ground</span></td><td>$<!-- -->1099</td><td>Wi-Fi Connectivity:</td><td><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm fw-bold text-nowrap ">Check Price</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 class="text-center mb-4">In-Depth Mini Reviews</h2><div><div id="review-Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus" class="card mb-4"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-md-4 text-center p-4 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-white"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/4f1de64dc1be474a/EP_Large-Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus-2025.webp" class="img-fluid rounded-start" alt="Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus" style="max-height:200px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="col-md-8"><div class="card-body"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start"><div><h3 class="card-title h4">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</h3><span class="badge bg-primary mb-2">Best In-Ground Overall</span></div><div class="text-end"><div class="h4 mb-0 text-primary">$<!-- -->799</div></div></div><div class="card-text mt-3">A popular choice for many pool owners. It features clever cleaning technology and easy-to-clean filters.</div><p class="card-text"><strong>Why we picked it:</strong></p><div class="card-text"><p>A great baseline choice for many in-ground pools. It balances coverage and maintenance simplicity, making it easy to run consistently—which matters more than people expect.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Read Full Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning fw-bold ">Check Price on Amazon</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="review-Dolphin-Premier" class="card mb-4"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-md-4 text-center p-4 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-white"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-start" alt="Dolphin Premier" style="max-height:200px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="col-md-8"><div class="card-body"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start"><div><h3 class="card-title h4">Dolphin Premier</h3><span class="badge bg-primary mb-2">Best for Seasonal Debris</span></div><div class="text-end"><div class="h4 mb-0 text-primary">$<!-- -->1599</div></div></div><div class="card-text mt-3">Features multi-media filtration and an anti-tangle swivel cable, making it a top-tier choice.</div><p class="card-text"><strong>Why we picked it:</strong></p><div class="card-text"><p>Ideal when debris conditions change across the year. This is a strong fit for pools that deal with leaves in the fall and finer debris in warmer months.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Read Full Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning fw-bold ">Check Price on Amazon</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="review-Polaris-9650iQ-Sport" class="card mb-4"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-md-4 text-center p-4 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-white"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6" class="img-fluid rounded-start" alt="Polaris 9650iQ Sport" style="max-height:200px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="col-md-8"><div class="card-body"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start"><div><h3 class="card-title h4">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</h3><span class="badge bg-primary mb-2">Best Premium In-Ground</span></div><div class="text-end"><div class="h4 mb-0 text-primary">$<!-- -->1099</div></div></div><div class="card-text mt-3">This smart cleaner connects to Wi-Fi and can be controlled via an app. Excellent for tech-savvy users.</div><p class="card-text"><strong>Why we picked it:</strong></p><div class="card-text"><p>A premium pick when you want more refined coverage behavior and a stronger feature set. Best for owners who want a “set it and forget it” experience and are willing to pay for it.</p><p><a href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Read the full review</a> or <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20">check current pricing</a>.</p></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Read Full Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning fw-bold ">Check Price on Amazon</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row mt-5"><div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto"><div class="card border-primary"><div class="card-header bg-primary text-white"><h3 class="h5 mb-0">Buying Advice</h3></div><div class="card-body"><h3>In-Ground Buying Advice</h3><p>Choose based on pool size first, then debris type. If your pool is large or deep, prioritize runtime and efficient coverage. If your pool is leaf-heavy, prioritize basket capacity and easy cleaning. If you’re choosing between power styles, see <a href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners">Corded vs Cordless</a>.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p><strong>Should in-ground owners prioritize wall climbing?</strong><br>Usually, yes—walls are a major surface area, and wall cleaning reduces manual brushing.</p><p><strong>How long should a cleaning cycle take?</strong><br>In many in-ground pools, 2–3 hours is typical depending on size and debris.</p></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"645\",\"static/chunks/app/best-of/%5BlistId%5D/page-87d2dc40e1048963.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[5826,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"645\",\"static/chunks/app/best-of/%5BlistId%5D/page-87d2dc40e1048963.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-