\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn many in-ground pools, 2–3 hours is typical depending on size and debris.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{}]]}],null],\"segment\":\"__PAGE__?{\\\"listId\\\":\\\"inground\\\"}\"},\"styles\":null}],\"segment\":[\"listId\",\"inground\",\"d\"]},\"styles\":null}],\"segment\":\"best-of\"},\"styles\":null}]}],[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-1\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" \",\"The Pool Lab\",\". All rights reserved.\"]}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white-50\",\"children\":[\"The Pool Lab\",\" is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.\"]}],[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{}]]}]}],null]}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Best Robotic Pool Cleaners for In-Ground Pools (2026) - The Pool Lab\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"In-ground pools benefit from stronger wall coverage, longer runtimes, and better filtration—especially in larger, deeper installations.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.the-pool-lab.com/best-of/inground\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Best Robotic Pool Cleaners for In-Ground Pools (2026)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"In-ground pools benefit from stronger wall coverage, longer runtimes, and better filtration—especially in larger, deeper installations.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https:/